    "instruction": "Return one impact-response-v4 JSON object. Follow the current coordination stage. Discovery: read every frozen discovery_task member, propose one set of rule changes citing T refs from fixed_text_evidence. For finish return evidence_outcomes in member order using P/D refs, with outcome and a specific reason for each member. Declare analyzed only after its complete evidence was supplied; insufficient/unprocessed must remain explicit. Never copy group success to every member. Case stage: compare every R rule with complete case JSON, execution_notes and its original sources; return rule_ref/case_impacts, literal paths and actual values; evidence_outcomes is empty. All formal identities/positions/hashes belong to the server. For read return only fixed P/S/C/D reads, no outcome, candidates or evidence_outcomes. Keep negative conditions. Catalogs are metadata, not read evidence. All proposals pending review; deployment unknown. No test execution or official-record changes.",
    "sha256": "48a136981445bd39ff96760381eacb1f4ecd60f3c7e9d4959bc87e77d3fdf722"
  },
  "workflow_protocol": {
    "version": "impact-coordinator-v2",
    "discovery_instruction": "从本次固定discovery_task组内全部原文与差异共同判断规则变化。返回一组规则候选及按成员顺序的逐证据outcome/reason；normalized用于辅助，原文引用选择T。本阶段不需要读取用例，不提前提交用例影响；组成功不能代替逐证据处理声明。",
    "case_instruction": "对每条rules读取当前完整固定JSON、自身说明及已提供的编写来源。逐R引用返回当前用例影响与真实字段值；保留负向条件。discovery_results保留未完成范围，发现没有合法规则不能据此宣称无变化；没有规则也核对来源是否充分，缺少时保持依据不足。所有候选待评审，部署未知；evidence_outcomes为空，不重新提交文档发现。",
    "sha256": "b99e6c1087d78f7ce47b7d33f0b80b7f7254a689350e235b9d4fb028926167fa"
  },
